	<p align="justify"><font color="#FFFFFF">Trouvez Jahsohn Aksot (humain) vers la zone de Kithicor. Il se promène entre P60 P3600 et P950 P3500.<BR>Hailez-le puis suivez le dialogue :<BR><BR>PJ : 'Hail, Jahsohn Aksot'<BR>Jahsohn Aksot : 'Greetings, [PJ]'<BR><BR>Donnez-lui le Token of Mastery.<BR><BR>JA : 'What is this? I cannot believe you found it! Where did you get this?'<BR>PJ : 'Rykas gave it to me.'<BR>JA : 'I have not heard of anyone speaking that name out loud in years. Rykas once shared a tale with me, though I have lived with fear in my mind ever since. He told me afterwards that I did not have the balance I thought I had. Have you come for the Words of Magi'kot?'<BR>PJ : 'Yes I have come for the words of Magi'kot.'<BR>JA : 'The Words of Magi'kot can only be shared with those elementalists whose minds are of balance. The Words were separated into three pieces by a high council of Magi who feared that the story would bring an end to elementalists throughout Norrath. If you feel you wish to read from the sacred Power of the Orb then an elementalis of such power should easily accomplish this task.'<BR>PJ : 'What task ?'<BR>JA : 'Bring me the torn pages of Magi'kot. The first section can be found in the depths of a tainted forest, warded by an angry lupine. It is also rumored that one section is found in the haunted estate of a murderer, on a many armed creature. The last may be found in the belly of an amphibian who thirsts for blood.'<BR><BR>Ramenez-lui les 3 Torn Page of Magi'kot.</font></p><br><br>

